<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8746" root="حل" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِلٌّ</span></b>  an inf. n. of 1 [q. v.], in several senses.
(S, K &amp;c.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُهُورُ الحِلِّ</span>, (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْهُرُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحِلِّ</span>, (K,) [<i>The profane months;</i> i. e. <i>all the
months except those termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَشْهُرُ الحُرُمُ</span>: see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَامٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also a simple subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حلّل اليَمِينَ</span>:
see 2, in four places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَالٌ</span>, in seven
places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحِلُّ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>The region that is
without the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَم</span> [or <i>sacred territory</i>]. (S, Msb,
K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالٌّ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A5-  Also <i>A butt; an object
of aim, at which one shoots or throws.</i> (K.)

